mapping "W579.1" source="W579" target="217706007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 4 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W579 = Swedish SNOMED CT 10461000 217706007 extension of W57. Prior corpus annotator
        proposed SNOMED CT 136575 (Nonvenomous insect bite with infection) at legacy, but that target adds
        an infection qualifier absent from the ICD code (narrower, weak). Replacing with SNOMED CT 437478
        (217706007) - the Athena Maps-to target for parent W57 - which fully subsumes the source without
        adding qualifiers. Broader, moderate.
        """
}
